msgid "Loopback, private-use, shared, link-local, documentation, benchmarking, discard-only and multicast ranges. Globally reachable special-purpose exceptions remain eligible for user rules. The NTP exception applies only to traffic created by the router; LAN client UDP/123 still follows user rules."
