msgid "Non-globally-reachable and local destinations bypass Steer before user rules. Router-originated UDP NTP on port 123 always goes direct. Traditional TCP and UDP DNS on port 53 enters the dedicated DNS shim."
msgstr "非全球可达地址和本地目的地址会在用户规则之前绕过 Steer。路由器发起的 UDP 123 端口 NTP 始终直连，传统 TCP/UDP 53 端口 DNS 进入专用 DNS 辅助层。"

